        "cooked": "<p>Welcome! You're in good company, we're all obsessed as well. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"joseph.shoer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n joseph.shoer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How do I change my forum username from the default first half of my email address, assigned when I bought something from the store?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I can help here by casting Summon Moderator! A mod can change that for you.</p>",
